{"sourceUrl":"https://sme.hit.edu.cn/2025/0630/c17968a372867/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:55.041175+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sme.hit.edu.cn/2025/0630/c17968a372867/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><br/></p><p><span>诚挚欢迎全国各高校的优秀应届本科毕业生通过推荐免试方式来我院攻读硕士（博士）学位研究生。具体安排如下：</span></p><p><span><span><strong>1</strong></span><span><strong>、基本修业年限</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>硕士生基本修业年限为</span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>年，直博生基本修业年限为</span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>2</strong></span><span><strong>、申请条件</strong></span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>1</span><span>）在满足我校接收推免生的相关要求基础上，毕业专业</span><span><span>一般</span></span><span>应为</span><span><span>机械类、自控、电气、工程管理等</span></span><span>专业</span><span><span>和方向</span></span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>2</span><span>）其他要求（与学校相同）</span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>3</strong></span><span><strong>、审核流程</strong></span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>1</span><span>）审核时间：申请人在完成预报名后</span><span><span>（</span></span><span>网页版预报名地址：</span></span><span><span><a href=\"http://yzb.hit.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://yzb.hit.edu.cn</a></span><span>；选择进入“</span><span><span>推免生信息采集</span></span><span>”</span><span><span>）</span></span><span>，学院将分批进行审核</span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>大约每周审核一次到两次。</span></span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>2</span><span>）通知形式：学校将通过</span><span><span>推免生信息采集</span></span><span>系统及电话（或</span><span><span>邮件等</span></span><span>形式）分批次通知学生审核通过情况，</span><span><span>大约每隔</span></span></span><span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>天左右通知一次。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>4</strong></span><span><strong>、考核安排</strong></span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>1</span><span>）考核时间与方式（以通知为准）。</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>2</span><span>）考核</span><span><span>需提供排名</span></span><span><span>证明，各类科创获奖等证明材料，扫描件提交麦客表单：</span></span></span><span><span><span>https://hitsmeyb.mike-x.com/IfUrL</span></span><span><span>，同时学生面试时携带，应考官要求向考官展示。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>5</strong></span><span><strong>、其他</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）所有考生（包括本校应届本科毕业生）均须通过“推免生信息采集系统”进行报名。学院接收计划完成后，将不再接收未在系统中报名的考生。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）全国推免服务系统开通后，将根据接收计划、报名情况等确定录取名单。取得所在学校推免生资格且报考我院的上述校内外推免生，在规定时间内，登陆全国推免服务系统完成网上录取确认。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>6</strong></span></span><span><strong>、联系方式</strong></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>学院联系人：</span></span><span><span><span>姜老师、于老师</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>联系电话</span></span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span>0451-</span></span><span><span><span>86413811</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>邮箱</span></span><span><span><span>:jdyjs</span></span></span><span><span>@</span></span><span><span><span>hit.edu.cn</span></span></span></p><p><span>其他未尽事宜按学校相关文件及规定执行。</span></p><p><span></span><span><span>                                                                                         哈尔滨工业大学</span><span><span>机电工程</span></span><span>学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>    2025</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>30</span></span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"fa98c83278f414d974a9cb244ac45e307c7ecb793ec90a8bef114e86fee0838b","textLength":680,"sourceSha256":"319f1aa7d104bf344430c7cba94e8503710ac4a45e3a3858115e588de9ef0f26","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-07625ba32d359a56b08c","title":"2025年哈尔滨工业大学机电工程学院2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:55.041175+00:00"}
